116
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,840
Soh, our MVP, come here.

117
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,000
Right over here.

118
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
You, your time is up. Get lost.

119
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,720
- Thanks a lot.
- Come on, sit right here.

120
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,320
Now, let's see you tell P'Three
you love him.

121
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,000
- Tell P'Three I love him?
- That's right.

122
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,880
Turn that way. Face each other.

123
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,000
Ready?

124
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:39,000
