158
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:35,040
My heart races
when a flying cockroach comes at me, too.

159
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:40,440
(I wanted to invite you
to a meal, P'Three.)

160
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,320
(My treat, as a thank-you,)

161
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,360
