when I was sick.)

162
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:52,600
(Just having a meal
with someone you see as a "brother")

163
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,040
(shouldn't make you worry, right?)

164
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:03,000
Someone I see as a brother?

165
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,080
No, no, no.

166
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,040
Do I really like him?

167
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,400
No, no, no. No way.

168
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,560
Argh!

169
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,920
(Alright, let's just eat as bros.)

170
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,400
(Eat fast, finish fast.
Don't overthink it.)

171
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:41,640
Whoa, P'Three. You're going to choke.

172
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,520
