but they're not dating, either.

835
00:46:13,280 --> 00:46:15,640
They've been feeling each other out
for a long time now.

836
00:46:15,880 --> 00:46:17,960
Laem is too stubborn
to admit his feelings, though,

837
00:46:18,040 --> 00:46:19,360
