908
00:51:17,240 --> 00:51:18,440
I'm heading home now.

909
00:51:18,760 --> 00:51:19,440
Okay.

910
00:51:20,560 --> 00:51:22,120
Let home know when you get me. Oh, no...

911
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:26,640
Let me know when you get home.

912
00:51:55,320 --> 00:51:56,080
- What?
- What?

913
